023600     IF SUBC-SUBRO-CASE-ID = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
023700        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
023800        MOVE 'SUBRO_CASE_ID MISSING' TO ERR-TEXT
023900     END-IF
024000     IF SUBC-CLAIM-ID = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
