033300* --- 3000-POST-RECEIPT: POST ONE RECOVERY RECEIPT
033400 3000-POST-RECEIPT.
033500* RECOVERY RECEIPT: RECORD THE RECEIPT, THEN NET IT FROM THE CASE
033600* RESERVE (RECOVERY ESTIMATE AND OUTSTANDING) AND POST AN RC
033700*   MOVEMENT.
033800     MOVE SUBC-CLAIM-ID TO RCVR-CLAIM-ID
033900     MOVE SUBC-SUBRO-CASE-ID TO RCVR-SUBRO-CASE-ID
034000     MOVE 'SB' TO RCVR-RCV-TYPE-CD
034100     MOVE WS-RECEIPT-AMT TO RCVR-RCV-RECEIVED-AMT
034200     MOVE 'PT' TO RCVR-RCV-STATUS
034300     EXEC SQL
034400         INSERT INTO CLR.T_RECOVERY
034500              ( CLAIM_ID, SUBRO_CASE_ID, RCV_TYPE_CD
034600              , RCV_EXPECTED_AMT, RCV_RECEIVED_AMT
034700              , RCV_WRITE_OFF_AMT, WRITE_OFF_APPROVED_BY
034800              , RCV_STATUS, CURRENCY_CD, LAST_UPD_TS
034900              , LAST_UPD_PGM, LAST_UPD_USER )
035000         VALUES
035100              ( :RCVR-CLAIM-ID, :RCVR-SUBRO-CASE-ID
035200              , :RCVR-RCV-TYPE-CD, :RCVR-RCV-EXPECTED-AMT
035300              , :RCVR-RCV-RECEIVED-AMT, :RCVR-RCV-WRITE-OFF-AMT
035400              , :RCVR-WRITE-OFF-APPROVED-BY, :RCVR-RCV-STATUS
035500              , :RCVR-CURRENCY-CD, CURRENT TIMESTAMP
035600              , :WS-PGM-ID, :WS-USER-ID )
035700     END-EXEC
