039600        WHEN +100
039700           SET WS-ROW-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
039800        WHEN OTHER
039900           MOVE '3000-POST-RECEIPT' TO ERR-PARA
040000           PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
040100     END-EVALUATE
040200     MOVE SUBC-CLAIM-ID TO RSVM-CLAIM-ID
040300     COMPUTE WS-RECEIPT-AMT = 0 - WS-RECEIPT-AMT
040400     MOVE RSV-RSV-ID TO RSVM-RSV-ID
040500     MOVE SUBC-CLAIM-ID TO RSVM-CLAIM-ID
040600     MOVE 'RC' TO RSVM-MOVE-TYPE-CD
040700     MOVE WS-RECEIPT-AMT TO RSVM-MOVE-AMT
040800     MOVE 'RCPT' TO RSVM-REASON-CD
