041900              , :RSVM-MOVE-TYPE-CD, :RSVM-MOVE-AMT
042000              , :RSVM-MOVE-GBP-AMT, :RSVM-REASON-CD
042100              , :RSVM-USER-ID, :RSVM-PGM-ID
042200              , :RSVM-EXTRACTED-FLAG )
